# 📐 CAD Engineering Drawings Lab

> **Educational & Practical Repository** for storing, structuring, and practicing Computer-Aided Design (CAD) drawings, drafted with **AutoCAD** and related software.

---

## 📌 Overview

This repository is dedicated to consolidating educational materials, practical drafting assignments, and standard 2D technical drawings. It serves as a personal collection of engineering practice and CAD drafting exercises.

### 🎯 Key Objectives:
- ✍️ Mastering 2D drafting tools and techniques in **AutoCAD**.
- 📐 Practicing adherence to standard technical drawing guidelines (ISO / ANSI / national standards).
- 🧩 Managing reusable blocks, layers, and drawing templates.
- 📁 Maintaining a structured portfolio of 2D CAD designs.

---

## 📂 Repository Structure

The drawings are organized chronologically by year and drawing number (`[Year]/[Number]/`):

```text
.
├── 📄 README.md
├── 📂 Templates/                 # Standard drawing frames, title blocks, and .dwt files
└── 📂 2026/                      # Year directory
    ├── 📂 01/                    # Drawing #1
    │   ├── drawing_01.dwg        # Primary CAD source file
    │   └── drawing_01.pdf        # Exported PDF version for quick preview
    ├── 📂 02/                    # Drawing #2
    │   ├── drawing_02.dwg
    │   └── drawing_02.pdf
    └── 📂 ...